[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0020","text":"对吧，太好了！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0030","text":"嗯！\n很合适哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0050","text":"巡？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0060","text":"不是啦……！\n是因为这套演出服太棒了，所以有点在意"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0070","text":"我觉得自己必须加油才行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0080","text":"为了能让大家看到配得上这么棒的设计的表演……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0090","text":"巡的话，一定没问题的\n只要有这份心气"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0100","text":"……嗯！\n我会努力到能让自己也这么觉得的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20301300_01_0102","text":"Motion"}]
